# Ocarina Linux keyboard map: conventional menu controls.
player 1 keyboard on
player 1 key A Return
player 1 key B Escape
player 1 key X X
player 1 key Y Y
player 1 key LS F
player 1 key RS G
player 1 key L Q
player 1 key R E
player 1 key ZL Z
player 1 key ZR C
